OL,3,AAs Michigan Senate race heats up, Vance
OL,4,Acalls El-Sayed 'evil'
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS Vice-President JD Vance has waded
OL,7,Finto Michigan's bitter senate race,
OL,8,Fcalling Democratic newcomer Abdul
OL,9,FEl-Sayed "evil" as he backs Trump ally
OL,10,FMike Rogers in the closely-fought
OL,11,Fcontest.
OL,13,FAt an event to support Rogers, Vance
OL,14,Falso warned El-Sayed to "keep my wife's
OL,15,Fname the hell out of your mouth", after
OL,16,Fthe candidate appeared to suggest that
OL,17,FVance's late grandfather would not
OL,18,Faccept Second Lady Usha Vance, who is
OL,19,FHindu.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
