OL,3,AAs Michigan Senate race heats up, Vance
OL,4,Acalls El-Sayed 'evil'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEl-Sayed hit back at Vance later on
OL,7,FMonday, accusing the Trump
OL,8,Fadministration of pushing "evil"
OL,9,Fpolicies and of "starting wars abroad
OL,10,Fwhen there's peace".
OL,12,FRecent polling suggests he holds a
OL,13,Fnarrow lead over Rogers in the key
OL,14,Fbattleground state.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
